/* Question 2 */

DRINKS = ( brown -> tick -> tock -> chocolate -> DRINKS
	| red -> tick -> tock -> tick -> coffee -> DRINKS
	| green -> tick -> tea -> DRINKS).

/*
Part A
------
The overall probability of producing coffee in this machine is 1/3,
since it is one of the only three options.
*/

/*
Part B
------
Once the green button is pressed, it takes 1 tick, or 1 transition,
to produce tea.
*/
